    "name": "Zodira",
    "subtitle": "Tarot, horoscope & insights",
    "description": "Zodira turns the ancient language of stars, cards and destiny into gentle guidance you can actually use.\nMade for beginners and enthusiasts alike, it brings Eastern and Western systems into one premium, private experience.\nFive tabs: Today, Tarot, Astrology, Destiny and Me.\nBirth details, readings, favourites and journal entries are processed and saved on your device. Calculations work offline; purchases, paired Apple Watch transfers, sharing and external links can use device connections or online services.\nPay once, unlock Pro for life, and keep a beautiful cosmic guide in your pocket.\nThe private Decision Journal includes up to 3 saved entries free. It is a secondary, private add-on opened from Today and Me, and it is never required to use a reading.",
